<title>USA: Citizens Financial Q4 Sept 30 net income rises.</title>
<headline>Citizens Financial Q4 Sept 30 net income rises.</headline>
<dateline>PROVIDENCE, R.I. 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Net		 28,000		   21,400</p>
<p> Net interest inc130,600		  92,200</p>
<p>			     12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Net		 128,200		  79,800</p>
<p> Net interest inc432,200		  367,700</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full company name is Citizens Financial Group Inc.</p>
<p>Citizens Financial is 76.5 percent owned by the Royal Bank of Scotland Group Plc, with the remainder owned by the Bank of Ireland.</p>
<p>Loan loss reserve at Sept 30 was $163.9 million, compared to a reserve of $158.3 million as of Sept, 1995.</p>
